nt-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span>\n            Ragati, Nguguini, Mukangu, Kibingoti, Thunguri, Kianjege, Chewa, Kibirigwi和Kiangai\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;widows: 2;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);outline: 0px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span>\n            ；合作社总的成员数有近7200户，算是肯尼亚比较大的合作社了\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n           。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SnDJzVBSVj90b8rEwIicdTJ4ByFia4sSvUHOPuS0VCBXblBGuNl1Y0XicagPCjf54hmf3VoRlS0vXsQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7S9XRhXhQMII7rELicTM5TUxFuWSmiaygdR4VYH3w08d8xnVk5403A9OXnmWR2eicuOgLLDwiba7AfVRQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helve